[h1]Smart Notifications (Closed Beta)[/h1]
[b]Less notification noise, a watchlist for the countries you actually care about, and new alerts vanilla is missing.[/b]

Vanilla buries the things you actually need to act on in a wall of low-value popups, while diplomatic plays on the other side of the map interrupt you just as often as ones involving you. This mod retunes what pops up, lets you flag the countries you actually care about, and adds a few alerts the base game should have had.

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Key Features[/h1]

[b]Country watchlist[/b]
[list]
[*] Flag specific countries (rivals, allies, threats).
[*] Diplomatic plays, wars, and countries joining a side only pop up when a watchlisted country (or you) is actually involved.
[*] Everything else quietly goes to the feed instead of interrupting you.
[/list]

[b]Retuned notification defaults[/b]
[list]
[*] Low-value vanilla notifications demoted from popup/toast to feed.
[*] Repetitive dominion/subject diplomatic notifications quieted.
[/list]

[b]New alerts[/b]
[list]
[*] [b]Taxation Deficit[/b] — alert plus a one-time toast naming the specific state, when its tax capacity can't keep up with usage.
[*] [b]Agitator Invite Available[/b] — fires when you have an open agitator slot and an exiled character eligible to fill it.
[*] [b]Law Ready to Enact[/b] — flag a law you're working toward from its detail panel; get an alert plus a one-time toast naming that law and its law group the moment it has better odds of passing than stalling.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Compatibility[/h1]

[list]
[*] [b]Game version:[/b] 1.13.* (current patch)
[*] [b]Save games:[/b] safe to add mid-campaign. Removal is expected safe too (script/UI only, no new mechanics) but not yet stress-tested across many saves — report back if you try it.
[*] [b]Achievements:[/b] unaffected — only debug mode disables achievements, not mods.
[*] [b]Ironman:[/b] not applicable, Victoria 3 has no Ironman mode.
[*] [b]File overrides:[/b] this mod fully overrides [i]common/messages/00_messages.txt[/i] (needed for the notification retuning). [i]common/alert_types/[/i] and [i]common/alert_groups/[/i] are additive — no vanilla file touched there.
[/list]

[b]Known conflicts:[/b] any other mod that also fully overrides [i]common/messages/00_messages.txt[/i] — whichever loads later in your playset wins for that whole file, they don't merge. Check for that specific overlap if you run another notification-tuning mod. No other conflicts known as of this beta.

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Reporting Issues[/h1]

This is a closed beta. If something's off, include:
[list]
[*] What you expected vs. what happened.
[*] Your Victoria 3 version and other mods enabled.
[*] Your [i]debug.log[/i]/[i]error.log[/i] from [i]Documents\Paradox Interactive\Victoria 3\logs\[/i], if you can — this mod logs specifically so issues can be diagnosed from those files.
[/list]

Source and issue tracker: [url=https://github.com/dcoullon/victoria3-smart-notifications]github.com/dcoullon/victoria3-smart-notifications[/url]
